    "provision_type": "section",
    "primary_num": "4",
    "secondary_num": null,
    "title": "Succession of grandchildren in case of death of any son or daughter of the propositus",
    "title_only": "Succession of grandchildren in case of death of any son or daughter of the propositus",
    "text": "In the event of death of any son or daughter of the propositus before the opening of succession, the children of such son or daughter, if any, living at the time the succession opens, shall per stirpes receive a share equivalent to the share which such son or daughter, as the case may be, would have received if alive.",
